  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The alternating current is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>42</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The R.M.S. value of this current is __________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given function of current is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>42</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>It means,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><msqrt><mn>42</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"&#62;\" open=\"&#60;\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>42</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p>RMS value of the current is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced open=\"&#60;\" close=\"&#62;\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>121</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>",
